+## Session expiry
+
+`save_session` records an `issued_at` timestamp. `load_session` rejects a session
+older than `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds) with `SessionExpiredError`, and calls
+`purge_expired()` to delete expired entries from the on-disk cache
+(`/tmp/sessioncache`). Resume blobs are base64-encoded JSON.
+
+Note: `issued_at` in a client-held blob is not signed; add an HMAC if clients are untrusted.
+
